abstract: "An evidence-bound comprehensive edition of the ThoxWork paper of record: governed Digital Employees, MeshGroups with a pooled-capacity admission rule, the Rolodex state machine with a person-only approval gate, and hash-chained evidence. It merges product-measured evidence (3,747 product tests rerun, planner and reference-kit agreement studies, an admission-rule divergence study, Evidence Lab tamper-detection and cost measurements) with a measured replay of the protocol experiments against the live ThoxWork core service (Section 7.7)."
